  "question": {
    "text": "An electromagnetic wave is represented by the electric filed <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></math> Taking unit vectors in <math><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></math> and <math><mi>z</mi></math> directions to be <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math> the directions of propogations <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo></math> is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
